42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, exactly. The mid-city runs are slower, but platforms clear fine.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, yes, the ground is unpredictable.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, the data terms are a blocker for any integrated system.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,So the integrated fare platform is stuck on data agreements.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,And the night extension is impossible without more crews.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The bus corridor might help the mid-city speed, but not the waiting.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"The station upgrades are risky due to the shells, but the accessibility records were good.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The ticketing fees are high, but the paving rates are climbing too.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,We need a plan that doesn't rely on new crews or new data deals.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The station upgrades have spare maintenance capacity.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,Agreed. The accessibility programme finished on time last time.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,Agreed. The lift maintenance contract has spare crew.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. The capital balance is available for construction.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
